sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CI as CI job
    participant Cl as Build client
    participant Reg as Regional cache
    participant Obj as Object store
    participant Peer as Peer region
    CI->>Cl: build target
    Cl->>Cl: hash inputs — sources, deps, toolchain
    Cl->>Reg: GET by content hash
    alt hit
        Reg-->>CI: artifact, build skipped
    else miss
        Reg->>Peer: ask the nearest region
        alt peer has it
            Peer-->>Reg: artifact
            Reg-->>CI: artifact
        else genuinely absent
            Reg-->>Cl: miss
            Cl->>CI: build locally
            CI->>Reg: upload keyed by the same hash
            Reg->>Obj: persist and replicate
        end
    end
    Note over Cl: identical inputs must produce the same key, or the cache is worse than useless
